---
---

<section id="franchise-cta" class="relative py-28 sm:py-36 bg-[#0E1217] text-white overflow-hidden border-b border-stone-800">
  
  <!-- Background Image with Dark Luxury Overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="/images/mutfak-ve-sef.jpg"
      alt="Kutuda Makarna profesyonel mutfak, şef ve restoran atmosferi"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-25 scale-105"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0E1217] via-[#0E1217]/90 to-[#0E1217]/80"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Warm Gold Glow in background -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 right-1/4 -translate-y-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-[#FFB800]/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text & Action Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FFB800]/15 border border-[#FFB800]/30 text-amber-400 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest">
          <span>💼</span>
          <span>FRANCHISE FIRSATI</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight uppercase font-sans leading-tight">
          BU HİKÂYENİN BİR PARÇASI<br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFB800] via-[#F59E0B] to-[#D97706]">
            OLMAK İSTER MİSİN?
          </span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-2xl text-stone-300 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-2xl text-balance">
          Başarılı bir restoran konseptini kendi şehrinizde hayata geçirmek ister misiniz?
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-light">
          Yüksek kârlılık, kanıtlanmış operasyonel sistem, anahtar teslim mutfak kurulumu ve merkezi taze tedarik desteğiyle Kutuda Makarna ailesine katılın.
        </p>

        <!-- Buttons: "Franchise Başvurusu" & "Franchise Modelini İncele" -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4">
          <a
            href="/franchise#basvuru"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFB800] hover:bg-[#F59E0B] text-[#1C1917] font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/20 transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Franchise Başvurusu</span>
            <span>📝</span>
          </a>

          <a
            href="/franchise"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 border border-white/25 text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>Franchise Modelini İncele</span>
            <span>→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: 4 Core Advantages Bento -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">⚡</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">3 Dk Servis</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Özel hızlı haşlama ve tavada sos bağlama teknolojisi.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">📈</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Yüksek ROI</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Düşük fire oranı ve hızlı ciro dönüşümü.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🚚</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Merkezi Tedarik</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Tüm taze makarnalar ve özel soslar hazır ulaştırılır.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-xs space-y-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🎓</span>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Eğitim Akademisi</h4>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 leading-relaxed">Mutfak şefleri ve servis personeli için eksiksiz eğitim.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
